 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "Are your leads also resting in an Excel sheet?",
   "start": 0.04,
   "end": 2.8
  },
  {
   "text": "You spend money on ads.",
   "start": 2.8,
   "end": 4.11
  },
  {
   "text": "A lead comes in, you talk to them once, and that's the end of it.",
   "start": 4.39,
   "end": 8.26
  },
  {
   "text": "But the truth is, a lead often needs at least four follow-ups before they convert.",
   "start": 8.26,
   "end": 13.12
  },
  {
   "text": "And after one conversation, you can't re-target them either.",
   "start": 13.12,
   "end": 16.6
  },
  {
   "text": "Let's understand this with an example.",
   "start": 16.69,
   "end": 18.48
  },
  {
   "text": "You ran an ad and ten leads came in, three of them converted.",
   "start": 18.48,
   "end": 22.44
  },
  {
   "text": "But you paid for all ten.",
   "start": 22.44,
   "end": 25.16
  },
  {
   "text": "And the other seven?",
   "start": 25.16,
   "end": 26.4
  },
  {
   "text": "Either they're sitting in Excel or in some staff member's phone.",
   "start": 26.4,
   "end": 29.78
  },
  {
   "text": "That money is simply wasted.",
   "start": 29.78,
   "end": 32.04
  },
  {
   "text": "This is the problem WACRM by Magicbolt AI solves.",
   "start": 32.04,
   "end": 35.58
  },
  {
   "text": "A complete AI automation software.",
   "start": 35.8,
   "end": 38.48
  },
  {
   "text": "The moment a new lead comes in, WhatsApp Automation manages and nurtures them instantly.",
   "start": 38.48,
   "end": 44
  },
  {
   "text": "Then AI agents make AI calls and convert them with the right pitch.",
   "start": 44,
   "end": 48.32
  },
  {
   "text": "And for leads who don't reply, it builds a complete sales pipeline so they can be re-targeted in the future.",
   "start": 48.32,
   "end": 54.24
  },
  {
   "text": "The result?",
   "start": 54.26,
   "end": 55.24
  },
  {
   "text": "Four conversions, a chance to grow your sales and revenue up to ten times, and a team that stays productive.",
   "start": 55.24,
   "end": 61.62
  },
  {
   "text": "WACRM by Magicbolt AI.",
   "start": 61.67,
   "end": 64.06
  },
  {
   "text": "Visit WACRM.in today.",
   "start": 64.1,
   "end": 66.3
  }
 ]
